  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Midnight Collector Gallery",
    "overview": "Badgecraft presents real badge artwork as collectible objects on midnight charcoal surfaces. Blurple actions, lavender hierarchy, and family-specific cyan, pink, and amber accents give the gallery its gaming character without overwhelming the artwork. Space Grotesk headings establish a geometric voice; DM Sans carries the smaller controls and explanations.\n\nDepth is restrained and local: outlined panels organize the page, while soft lighting supports badge artwork and profile previews. The progression slider and editable profile playground are the signature interactions. Profiles remain clearly labelled simulations, consistent with PRODUCT.md.\n\nThe user-approved hero spotlight adapts UnkindledOne’s sunset profile with generated banner/avatar art, a scoped amber/umber surface and Lilita One nickname. Its fixed identity and badge styles are independent of the unchanged customizable playground. See dist/featured-profile.css and dist/assets/unkindled-artwork.json.\n\nThe merged community-script guide preserves the existing editor and design tokens. Six numbered steps, an amber risk notice, and compact prerequisites pair with the read-only Python source. Its styles are scoped in community-tools.css and collapse to one column below 860px. Website credential collection and script execution are absent.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Real badge artwork anchors the visual hierarchy.",
      "Charcoal surfaces with blurple actions and localized colored light.",
      "Geometric headings paired with compact, readable controls.",
      "Responsive explorer and profile preview with explicit selected states."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Local Light Rule",
        "body": "Colored gradients and glows belong around artwork and preview stages; panel structure comes from borders and tonal contrast.",
        "section": "colors"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do preserve real badge artwork and its attribution.",
      "Do use blurple for primary actions and lavender for active navigation and focus.",
      "Do use each badge family’s color consistently in its card, explorer, timeline, and range control.",
      "Do keep selected states visible through borders, checks, labels, or artwork opacity as well as color.",
      "Do preserve keyboard focus and the reduced-motion branch.",
      "Do keep the UnkindledOne hero identity separate from visitor playground edits."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don’t replace the shipped charcoal palette with a light theme.",
      "Don’t spread the artwork glows across ordinary text or every panel.",
      "Don’t replace the geometric heading and DM Sans pairing with a different visual voice.",
      "Don’t shrink the mobile milestone timeline to force ten tiers into the viewport; preserve horizontal scrolling.",
      "Don’t remove the visible simulation labels from profile previews."
    ]
  }
}
